# Firmware's cv6xx config turns CMA on (OpenIPC/firmware 97d1c26), and with it
# the kernel builds hisi_mem (drivers/vendor/cma): it measures DRAM, lays the
# media zone out itself, and load_hisilicon follows that layout. This board
# boots from fpvboot with mem=64m and no mmz=, and without hisi_mem
# load_hisilicon computes the zone from those exactly as it did before. Kept
# that way until hisi_mem has run on the air unit.
# CONFIG_CMA is not set
